sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Flutter as Flutter PracticeView
    participant VM as PracticeViewModel
    participant Endpoint as PracticeEndpoint
    participant Service as PracticeService
    participant Selector as CardSelector
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Student->>Flutter: Open Practice Screen
    Flutter->>VM: loadNextCommand.execute()
    VM->>Endpoint: nextCard(courseId)
    Endpoint->>Service: serveNextCard(learnerId, courseId)
    Service->>Selector: selectNextCard(learnerId, courseId)
    Selector->>DB: Query overdue review cards (dueAt <= now ASC)
    alt Review card due
        DB-->>Selector: Return overdue Question
    else No reviews due
        Selector->>DB: Query unattempted card (position ASC)
        DB-->>Selector: Return new Question
    end
    Selector-->>Service: Selected Question
    Service->>DB: Update ReviewState (lastServedAt = now, helpUsed = false)
    Service->>DB: If MCQ, fetch QuestionOptions (id, text only)
    Service-->>Endpoint: PracticeItem (QuestionView without answers or notes)
    Endpoint-->>VM: PracticeItem
    VM->>Flutter: Update PracticeUiState.QuestionShown
    Flutter-->>Student: Display prompt, timer, and choice buttons (or input box)
